  "name": "FungMod",
  "description": "Traceable, unit-aware scientific modelling framework for fungal and enzyme-mediated substrate degradation. FungMod connects explicit mechanisms and provenance-backed parameters to trajectories, summary metrics, uncertainty summaries, provenance, limitations, and suggested follow-up experiments, while keeping missing inputs explicit and never presenting software verification as empirical validation.",
